t":"1. 术后6小时平卧禁食禁水，可用湿棉签润唇\n2. 6小时后可少量饮水，排气后进流食\n3. 鼓励尽早翻身活动，防肠粘连和血栓\n4. 24小时后拔尿管，尝试下床走动\n5. 伤口保持干燥，使用收腹带保护\n6. 恶露观察：量多鲜红→渐少暗红→白色\n7. 术后痛感强可请求镇痛泵\n8. 产后42天复查"},{"category":"newborn","title":"👶 新生儿黄疸须知","content":"1. 生理性黄疸：出生2-3天出现，7-14天消退\n2. 母乳性黄疸：可持续数周，一般无需停母乳\n3. 观察：面部→胸腹→四肢→手心，黄染范围扩大需就医\n4. 处理：多吃多排、适当晒太阳（隔着玻璃无效，需户外散射光）\n5. 就医信号：出生24小时内出现黄疸、血清胆红素超标\n6. 蓝光治疗是最有效安全的方式"}],"spending":{"month":[{"name":"安心裤","amount":4.9,"date":"2026-07-31","note":"4条·产后护理","isMilk":false,"isDiaper":false,"subCategory":"纸品","expiryDate":""},{"name":"会阴冲洗器","amount":15.9,"date":"2026-07-31","note":"1个·产后护理","isMilk":false,"isDiaper":false,"subCategory":"洗护","expiryDate":""},{"name":"一次性内裤","amount":46.53,"date":"2026-07-31","note":"26条·产后护理","isMilk":false,"isDiaper":false,"subCategory":"纸品","expiryDate":""},{"name":"计量型卫生巾","amount":23.8,"date":"2026-07-31","note":"6片·产后护理","isMilk":false,"isDiaper":false,"subCategory":"纸品","expiryDate":""},{"name":"骨盆矫正带","amount":54,"date":"2026-07-31","note":"1个·产后护理","isMilk":false,"isDiaper":false,"subCategory":"其他","expiryDate":""},{"name":"折叠盆","amount":69.9,"date":"2026-07-31","note":"","isMilk":false,"isDiaper":false,"subCategory":"洗护","expiryDate":""},{"name":"月子鞋","amount":22.9,"date":"2026-08-25","note":"1双","isMilk":false,"isDiaper":false,"subCategory":"家居","expiryDate":""},{"name":"产褥垫","amount":9.2,"date":"2026-07-31","note":"12片","isMilk":false,"isDiaper":false,"subCategory":"其他","expiryDate":""},{"name":"月子服","amount":119.8,"date":"2026-08-25","note":"2套","isMilk":false,"isDiaper":false,"subCategory":"衣物","expiryDate":""},{"name":"产褥垫","amount":17.19,"date":"2026-08-26","note":"12片","isMilk":false,"isDiaper":false,"subCategory":"纸品","expiryDate":""},{"name":"刀纸","amount":12.9,"date":"2026-08-26","note":"2包","isMilk":false,"isDiaper":false,"subCategory":"纸品","expiryDate":""}],"daily":[{"name":"52码婴儿衣服","amount":49.9,"date":"2026-07-31","note":"2件·衣物","isMilk":false,"isDiaper":false},{"name":"59码夹棉婴儿衣服","amount":53,"date":"2026-07-31","